# Play test of Cinderfall (CIPlay cinderfall, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the camp on the ash
# plain (3.2 m), the turbine hall's pad (3.45 m), the valves' ledges - the west plateau (10.4 m), the south-east spur
# (7 m), the north shoulder (16 m) up the ramp. Quest "Pressure", 10 steps: camp, warning, valve 1, valve 2, the nest,
# the matriarch, valve 3, the hall, its roaches, the store opened.
island Cinderfall
expect step 0
expect title Pressure

# The workers' camp: the engineer's warning on a crate
walk -10 60 to -10 49 to -11.5 46.2 h=3.2
zone camp
expect step 1
read Engineer's warning
expect step 2

# The west plateau's valve
walk -14 44 to -40 34 to -60 24 to -58 10 to -57.5 4 to -55.5 -0.4 h=10.4
use valve1
expect message groans shut
expect story valvetag 1
expect step 3

# The south-east spur's valve
walk 12 40 to 26 26 to 34 4 to 32 -18 to 30.5 -25.4 h=7
use valve2
expect story valvetag 2
expect step 4

# Up the ramp to the north shoulder: the stone birds' matriarch, the third valve
walk 20 32 to 13 27 to 6.4 22.2 to -1 17.3 to -6 14.4 h=16
zone nest
expect step 5
kill Screecher
expect step 6
use valve3
expect story valvetag 3
expect step 7

# Down to the turbine hall: its roaches, then the plant's store
walk 1.5 42 to 1.5 37.5 to 1.5 33.5 h=3.6
zone hall
expect step 8
kill Roach
expect step 9
walk 1.5 34 to 2.5 31 to 4 29.6 h=3.6 below=6
reach Plant store
open Plant store
wait 5
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect item Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel 1
expect done
